		"description": "Demo collection for the Spring Boot JPA sample that comes before the lab-web-data lab.\n\nBefore you start:\n1. MySQL is running, and spring_db / spring_user exist.\n2. The app is running:  mvn spring-boot:run\n\nThe API key header is set once on the collection (Authorization tab), so every request inherits it. Only 'No API key' overrides it, to show what happens without it.\n\nRun the folders top to bottom. The Transactions folder tells a story: member 2 borrows book 3, cannot borrow it twice, and then returns it.\n\nVariables: baseUrl and apikey are on the collection - change them there, not in each request.",
